[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2401.109, "timestamp": "00:40:01", "text": "我喜欢阅读文章，因为我仍然喜欢阅读文章。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2403.27, "timestamp": "00:40:03", "text": "因为有时一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2407.349, "timestamp": "00:40:07", "text": "一些真正的作家，比如……他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2409.43, "timestamp": "00:40:09", "text": "只要有点幽默感就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2412.31, "timestamp": "00:40:12", "text": "很微妙，你甚至不会注意到它，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2414.63, "timestamp": "00:40:14", "text": "它就像藏在里面一样。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2417.03, "timestamp": "00:40:17", "text": "就像这里有点讽刺意味，有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2419.27, "timestamp": "00:40:19", "text": "这里有个你可能没注意到的有趣俏皮话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2421.67, "timestamp": "00:40:21", "text": "他们要安装的。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2423.589, "timestamp": "00:40:23", "text": "唉，看来我错过了很多阅读的机会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2425.91, "timestamp": "00:40:25", "text": "真是糟透了，你知道吗？然后还有类似这样的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2428.39, "timestamp": "00:40:28", "text": "一些随机的人写文章"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2429.91, "timestamp": "00:40:29", "text": "根本说不通，而且也不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2431.67, "timestamp": "00:40:31", "text": "请务必使用参考资料。因为如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2433.349, "timestamp": "00:40:33", "text": "有时看起来像文章，它们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2435.109, "timestamp": "00:40:35", "text": "就像有个参考资料一样，你进去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2437.27, "timestamp": "00:40:37", "text": "这些参考文献就像一个完全"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2439.03, "timestamp": "00:40:39", "text": "完全是另一回事，跟这无关"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2442.069, "timestamp": "00:40:42", "text": "完全没有。就像……就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2444.47, "timestamp": "00:40:44", "text": "就像一个真正的、合格的记者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2446.55, "timestamp": "00:40:46", "text": "网站上的一切都让人摸不着头脑，你到底在干什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2448.03, "timestamp": "00:40:48", "text": "正在做？你为什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2450.79, "timestamp": "00:40:50", "text": "这里？比如，你是怎么被允许发帖的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2453.51, "timestamp": "00:40:53", "text": "这其中还包含一些根本就不存在的参考文献。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2456.23, "timestamp": "00:40:56", "text": "有关的？我当时就想，天哪，这怎么可能？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2457.74, "timestamp": "00:40:57", "text": "在职的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2459.51, "timestamp": "00:40:59", "text": "[音乐]"}]